---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Manifesto | Practical Humanism">
	<article class="manifesto-container">
		<header class="manifesto-header">
			<h1>Manifesto</h1>
		</header>
		
		<blockquote class="manifesto-quote">
			"Man is a transitional being, he is not final; for in him and high beyond him ascend the radiant degrees which climb to a divine supermanhood." 
			<cite>— Sri Aurobindo</cite>
		</blockquote>

		<div class="manifesto-text">
			<p class="emphasized">
				I stand where the Ageless Wisdom intersects with the exactitudes of modern logic. 
				What I term <strong>Practical Humanism</strong> is a definite, pragmatic Method for the deliberate unfolding of human potential. 
				I recognize that the present human form is not an ultimate completion, but an intermediate stage.
			</p>

			<div class="separator">
				<span>✧</span>
			</div>

			<p>
				I cast aside nothing of the ancient tools; rather, I adapt them to present necessities.
			</p>

			<p>
				By applying these traditional instruments with a strictly practical, testing attitude, 
				I aim to awaken the dormant centers of the personality.
			</p>

			<div class="separator">
				<span>✧</span>
			</div>

			<p class="closing">
				To make of my own vehicle a living laboratory of evolution. 
				The Work demands the balanced development of the entire being: 
				the purification of the mind, the direction of the Will, 
				and the conscious realization of the Indwelling Spirit.
			</p>
		</div>

		<footer>
			<hr />
		</footer>
	</article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.manifesto-container {
		max-width: 650px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2rem 0;
	}
	.manifesto-header {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 4rem;
	}
	.manifesto-header h1 {
		font-size: 3.5rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--text-color);
		margin: 0;
	}
	.manifesto-quote {
		margin: 0 0 5rem 0;
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		line-height: 1.5;
		font-style: italic;
		color: var(--accent-muted);
		text-align: center;
		border: none;
		padding: 0;
	}
	.manifesto-quote cite {
		display: block;
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-style: normal;
		letter-spacing: 0.2em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		opacity: 0.7;
	}
	.manifesto-text {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		line-height: 2;
		color: var(--text-color);
		text-align: center;
	}
	.manifesto-text p {
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
	}
	.emphasized {
		font-size: 1.4rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
	}
	.separator {
		margin: 4rem 0;
		color: var(--accent-color);
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		opacity: 0.5;
	}
	.closing {
		font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
		font-style: italic;
		font-size: 1.4rem;
	}
	footer hr {
		margin-top: 5rem;
		opacity: 0.2;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.manifesto-header h1 {
			font-size: 2.5rem;
		}
		.manifesto-quote {
			font-size: 1.2rem;
			margin-bottom: 3rem;
		}
		.manifesto-text {
			font-size: 1.1rem;
		}
		.emphasized {
			font-size: 1.2rem;
		}
		.closing {
			font-size: 1.2rem;
		}
	}
</style>
